---
// Index landing for the docs example site.
//
// Real Astro docs sites would typically use content collections
// (`getCollection("docs")`) + a routing convention to render
// each MDX as its own page. The sample stays minimal: just lists
// the available screens so a maintainer can click through.
//
// The integration's `astro:config:setup` walker (Phase 4 polish)
// will populate the screen list automatically; until then this
// page hard-codes the one example screen for the dogfood.
---
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Annot Sample Docs</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Annot Sample Docs</h1>
    <p>
      Demonstrates <code>@ingcreators/annot-product-docs-astro</code>
      consuming a single annotated MDX screen.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/SC-001-login">SC-001 Login</a></li>
    </ul>
  </body>
</html>
